# fu143-goal-child-closeout — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml; per-row intent
# below). Columns: id | world | patch | env | expect
# in-progress        = baseline: in-progress child, merged strong link, no open PR → closeout
# strong-goal        = an open PR on the goal base STRONGLY links it → HELD (live work)
# bare-goal          = an open PR on the goal base only MENTIONS it → closeout (defect 1)
# strong-master      = an open PR on MASTER strongly links it → closeout (base scope, defect 1)
# cross-repo         = an open PR carries the cross-repo spelling `homelab#100` → closeout (defect 1)
# blocked-resolved   = agent/blocked child, blocked-on resolved → closeout (defect 2)
# blocked-unresolved = agent/blocked child, blocked-on unresolved → HELD (defect 2)
in-progress        |  |  |  | in-progress
strong-goal        |  |  |  | strong-goal
bare-goal          |  |  |  | bare-goal
strong-master      |  |  |  | strong-master
cross-repo         |  |  |  | cross-repo
blocked-resolved   |  |  |  | blocked-resolved
blocked-unresolved |  |  |  | blocked-unresolved
